[{"answer":"Hello, South City Cycling Club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hi.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I want to find out about joining the club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. I can help you there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm the club secretary and my name's Jim Hunter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hi Jim.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So, are you interested in membership for yourself?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/7.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/8.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Well there are basically two types of adult membership.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/9.mp3"},{"answer":"If you're pretty serious about cycling, there's the Full membership.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/10.mp3"},{"answer":"That costs $260","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and that covers you not just for ordinary cycling","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but also for races both here in the city and also in other parts of Australia.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Well, I'm not really up to that standard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I was more interested in just joining a group to do some cycling in my free time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/16.mp3"},{"answer":"That's why most people join.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/17.mp3"},{"answer":"So, in that case you'd be better with the Recreational membership.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/18.mp3"},{"answer":"That's $108 if you're over 19, and $95 if you're under.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm 25.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/20.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/21.mp3"},{"answer":"It's paid quarterly, and you can upgrade it later to the Full membership if you want to, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Now both types of membership include the club fee of $20.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/23.mp3"},{"answer":"They also provide insurance in case you have an accident, though we hope you won't need that, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/24.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/25.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well, I'll go with the Recreational membership, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/26.mp3"},{"answer":"And that allows me to join in the club activities, and so on?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/27.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And once you're a member of the club, you're also permitted to wear our kit when you're out cycling.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It's green and white.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I've seen cyclists wearing it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/31.mp3"},{"answer":"So, can I buy that at the club?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah.. no, it's made to order by a company in Brisbane.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/33.mp3"},{"answer":"You can find them online: they're called Jerriz.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/34.mp3"},{"answer":"That's JERRIZ.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/35.mp3"},{"answer":"You can use your membership number to put in an order on their website.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/36.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, can you tell me a bit about the rides I can do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/39.mp3"},{"answer":"So we have training rides pretty well every morning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and they're a really good way of improving your cycling skills as well as your general level of fitness,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/41.mp3"},{"answer":"but they're different levels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Level A is pretty fast - you're looking at about 30 or 35 kilometres an hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/43.mp3"},{"answer":"If you can do about 25 kilometres an hour, you'd probably be level B,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and then level C are the novices, who stay at about 15 kilometres per hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Well I reckon I'd be level B.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/47.mp3"},{"answer":"So, when are the sessions for that level?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... there are a couple each week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/49.mp3"},{"answer":"They're both early morning sessions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/50.mp3"},{"answer":"There's one on Tuesdays, and for that one you meet at 5.30 am,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/51.mp3"},{"answer":"and the meeting point's the stadium.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know where that is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's quite near my home, in fact.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/54.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, and how about the other one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/55.mp3"},{"answer":"That's on Thursdays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/56.mp3"},{"answer":"It starts at the same time, but they meet at the main gate to the park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that the one just past the shopping mall?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/58.mp3"},{"answer":"That's it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/59.mp3"},{"answer":"So how long are the rides?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah.. they're about an hour and a half.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/61.mp3"},{"answer":"So, if you have a job it's easy to fit in before you go to work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/62.mp3"},{"answer":"And the members often go somewhere for coffee afterwards, so it's quite a social event.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/63.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. That sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I've only just moved to the city so I don't actually know many people yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's a great way to meet people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/66.mp3"},{"answer":"And does each ride have a leader?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes, but not always.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/68.mp3"},{"answer":"But you don't really need one; the group members on the ride support one another, anyway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/69.mp3"},{"answer":"How would we know where to go?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/70.mp3"},{"answer":"If you check the club website, you'll see that the route for each ride is clearly marked.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/71.mp3"},{"answer":"So you can just print that out and take it along with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/72.mp3"},{"answer":"It's similar from one week to another, but it's not always exactly the same.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/73.mp3"},{"answer":"And what do I need to bring?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, bring a bottle of water, and your phone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/75.mp3"},{"answer":"You shouldn't use it while you're cycling, but have it with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/77.mp3"},{"answer":"And in winter, it's well before sunrise when we set out,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/78.mp3"},{"answer":"so you need to make sure your bike's got lights.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/79.mp3"},{"answer":"That's OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thanks Jim. I'd definitely like to join.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/81.mp3"},{"answer":"So what's the best way of going about it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah.. you can...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-2-part-1-2023-02-26-09-47-44/83.mp3"}]
